description: |
  Analog Devices AD5941 electrochemical front end, used by the thigh patch for
  constant-potential (amperometric) histamine sensing through its own
  register-level driver (thigh/src/drivers/ad5941.cpp).

compatible: "wearable,ad5941"

include: spi-device.yaml

properties:
  reset-gpios:
    type: phandle-array
    description: RESET input (active low). Optional; the driver also resets over SPI.
